  plcfast --> state
  cad --> state
  cammodule --> state
  state --> mqttsvc
  mqttsvc <--> broker
  broker <--> dashboard

  camera --> cammodule
  cammodule --> webrtcsvc
  webrtcsvc <--> broker
  webrtcsvc --> viewer
  broker <--> viewer

  shell -. exit safety: stop / home / clear buffer .-> plcfast

